.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH status 1  "status " 
.SH NAME
status \- Compare local snippets with the cloud (ahead/behind/diverged)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstatus\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare local snippets with the cloud (ahead/behind/diverged)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Only this snippet (default: everything tracked)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg status
  fg status ubuntu\-setup
